<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Jan trade deficit falls to $50.1 million.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Jan trade deficit falls to $50.1 million.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Friday:</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in million of dollars)</p>
<p>				Jan     Dec 95   Jan95</p>
<p>    Trade balance	-50.1     -66.1   +32.9</p>
<p>    Exports		615.4     651.4   652.6</p>
<p>    Imports		665.5     717.6   619.7</p>
<p>(NOTE: Differences due to rounding)</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-84</p>
</text>
